         "html_value": [
            {
               "text": "<p><hr /></p><p>Teaching is not about presenting facts to be memorized. To support learners of all ages, this page offers games and texts designed to encourage exploration and discovery of the world around us.</p><p>Although in school we are introduced to subjects called Science or Mathematics before entering university, teaching often stops at the initial stages of the discipline. These stages could be referred to as proto-Mathematics or pre-Mathematics, as proposed by Dr. Francisco González A. Redondo (<htcite0>; <htcite1>; <htcite2>; <htcite3>). In the texts of this section, we introduce the concepts of pre-Mathematics and proto-Mathematics, gradually building bridges to formal Mathematics.</p>",
