         "html_value": [
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><b><a href=\"index.html?page=class_content&arg=first_steps\" onclick=\"htLoadPage('first_steps','html', '', false); return false;\">Volume 1 – The Foundations of the Universe</a></b>: In this volume, we explore, through different cultures, how the numbers we use every day were discovered and how they have been used across different stages of human history.</p><p style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><b><a href=\"index.html?page=class_content&arg=first_steps_volume2\" onclick=\"htLoadPage('first_steps_volume2','html', '', false); return false;\">Volume 2 – Within Our Reach</a></b>: In this volume, we delve deeper into the world of numbers, expanding our understanding through the lens of different cultures.</p><p style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><b><a href=\"index.html?page=class_content&arg=shapes\" onclick=\"htLoadPage('shapes','html', '', false); return false;\">Volume 3 – Shapes</a></b>: In this volume, we explore geometric shapes across different cultures and their applications in everyday life.</p>",
